; abnf stdio.semio.model mutation (binary form)
; `encode_op`/`decode_op` carry NO envelope -- the binary form is exactly `serde_json::to_vec` of
; the tagged `SemioModelMutation` enum (see the sibling 📡️component.protocol.semio and
; ../📝️text/📖️component.grammar.semio for the JSON grammar those bytes decode as).
document = json-bytes
json-bytes = 1*OCTET  ; UTF-8 JSON text matching the text-facet `line` production, to end of stream
